  İSMİ:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:14;height:14.4pt'>
  <td width=817 colspan=4 valign=top style='width:439.2pt;border:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-alt:
  dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:14.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>TARİFE
  POZİSYONU:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
